From f9d46949e40e18637f4c51fcc878339552aa7409 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jefferson Nascimento <jnsagai@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 16:58:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(socom): separate service identity and discovery
 filters

Implement the service, offered-instance and find-request models proposed
in issue #84. Index services and duplicate server registrations by ID and
major, retain the offered minor with each server, and expose bounded local
discovery with optional minimum minor and instance filters.

Rename full connector contracts to Service_interface and migrate all
in-repository gateway, IPC, test, mock and benchmark callers. Document
source migration, snapshot semantics and caller-owned storage constraints.
Add identity, filter, lifecycle, capacity and concurrency regression cases.

Refs: #84
Assisted-by: OpenAI Codex (model revision unavailable)
Signed-off-by: Jefferson Nascimento <jnsagai@gmail.com>
